      "learning_outcomes": "After taking this course, students should be able to:\n\n* Familiarize with some of the current practice and research frontier in aerospace science and Earth informatics;\n* Have an insight into the development of the field in GBA and their future career;\n* Enhance group-work ability and team spirit.",
